{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d1f49c88a5863de35bf5df92ecc0aabd0c6a23f20f43782ac1a538ae9cdf56",
      "text": "各位，接下来终于要登台演唱主题曲了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cb467973d365a1b942bd294e9c0eda82c1291af4a69467ef14b38d61c637f7c",
      "text": "到目前为止除了开头的麦克风故障以外，\n完全没有发生厄运呢。今天说不定能顺利结束！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60c8f082b2ab8e5dea33694e766c25ed29d9a2db3084d66d7a2ba89364f7e9b",
      "text": "啊啊。相信为了今天所进行的训练，\n全力以赴去挑战吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542ec6e7e821b4a9caa8998897c46fb98c5f789bce12d2693f3042cc6e97db59",
      "text": "哦，差不多该出场了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，我们上阵了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9ee91e81a50b6846902989377cd5bc9bbe9df0d3c40f6ccc60c0fc291b74068",
      "text": "接下来就请各位欣赏歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0fc4036f578b315249ef28354bc4ddd89a259c4f7c0a8d14df284d6cfcc91d9",
      "text": "本月的主题曲，由FRAME的各位带来的\n《Plus 1 Good Day!》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a92f22f53a9eb16e61663ae6daa72c8bb20082e1f3c8088f2260f5558e6370d",
      "text": "（不管是任何人，都会有心情忧郁的日子吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c7b4b07500a062467551f7e42e5e66edd963ba6d9e581db78dcb6d79a08faf",
      "text": "（正因如此，才希望大家能听听这首歌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753c32c03ad0fbdea19777619d9ba6a6b110ddde7cd81fb3803cab16e30dfc58",
      "text": "（为了能让大家精神饱满地度过这一天，\n融入我们全部的应援去放声歌唱吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd4738de7559ccea4f20c13cc3a7aa35dd9d0ade80b0d34047c2fd78f2f9da7",
      "text": "谢谢大家的收听！\n那么在最后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cbe68379e6609bbc4c2badbbaf43b8380256e715a5173687430048e0dfb6be5",
      "text": "收看《7 in LIVE！》的各位观众。\n今天也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3a13ea12f98630daf4d19b5cbe815a0f4b68ad3a24009f25f318b2c6d60aa",
      "text": "路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
